    "title_en": "Bumpy inflation from explosive particle production",
    "abstract_en": "We present a first-principles derivation of an effective inflaton potential with a bumpy feature. We consider the coupling of a spectator field χto the inflaton φsuch that χis massive enough for almost all values of φ, but becomes massless when the inflaton crossed the value φ_\\star. This gives rise to a burst of χ-particle production at φ=φ_\\star. By taking the backreaction of the particle production, we obtain a bumpy feature in the effective potential.",
